[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 8401.75, "timestamp": "02:20:01", "text": "衣柜。我的父母也希望如此。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8403.27, "timestamp": "02:20:03", "text": "阿什利说：“你知道吗？当你"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8404.95, "timestamp": "02:20:04", "text": "你今天休息，就跟我们一起来吧。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8406.389, "timestamp": "02:20:06", "text": "我们打算给你买些衣服。”"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8407.99, "timestamp": "02:20:07", "text": "当时我就想：“我有衣服。”比如，“那些"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8409.67, "timestamp": "02:20:09", "text": "“不是衣服。” 那你就不穿"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8415.67, "timestamp": "02:20:15", "text": "那件衣服。是的。但我现在想要"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8417.349, "timestamp": "02:20:17", "text": "去买些动漫T恤。哦，还有"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8421.91, "timestamp": "02:20:21", "text": "有人看过《野良美》吗？是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8424.359, "timestamp": "02:20:24", "text": "是的。 Peekami太棒了。那里有"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8427.359, "timestamp": "02:20:27", "text": "Peekami太棒了。那里有 有个孩子，呃，他竟然跟我说了那句话"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8430.08, "timestamp": "02:20:30", "text": "有个孩子，呃，他竟然跟我说了那句话 我只记得这件事。哦，是的，我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8432.0, "timestamp": "02:20:32", "text": "我只记得这件事。哦，是的，我 拥有长见。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8438.07, "timestamp": "02:20:38", "text": "那折纸就像……我不知道我是否……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8439.99, "timestamp": "02:20:39", "text": "感觉不太像“喜欢”这个概念。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8442.79, "timestamp": "02:20:42", "text": "被低估的被高估的 你好 Vector 你"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8444.309, "timestamp": "02:20:44", "text": "不管你喜不喜欢，你就是喜欢它，仅仅因为"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8445.91, "timestamp": "02:20:45", "text": "你就是不喜欢，对吧？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8447.83, "timestamp": "02:20:47", "text": "这并不意味着，例如如果"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8449.19, "timestamp": "02:20:49", "text": "大家都喜欢它，只有你不喜欢。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8450.469, "timestamp": "02:20:50", "text": "这并不意味着“哦，我的天哪，这是……”"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8452.389, "timestamp": "02:20:52", "text": "被高估了，或者被低估了，或者其他什么情况"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8453.75, "timestamp": "02:20:53", "text": "你既喜欢它又不喜欢它。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8454.95, "timestamp": "02:20:54", "text": "就像人们意识到你并不廉价一样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8457.11, "timestamp": "02:20:57", "text": "绵羊，你是人，你有"}]